# .env.example — canonical environment template (P1-4, regenerated 2026-05-30)
# Generated from the live .env with ALL values stripped. Copy to .env and fill in.
# Keys are the complete current set the collector/dashboard/bots read.
# Backups: store .env.bak.* at ~/.unifiedcollector_env_backups/, NOT in the repo.

# UnifiedCollector — Unified Environment Configuration
# Auto-generated by scripts/migrate_env.py from legacy toolkit .env files.
# Review and adjust values before use.

